claim.claim-text:
obtaining a metallic precursor dissolved under an acidic condition, wherein the metallic precursor comprises a medical isotope;
contacting the dissolved metallic precursor with an octadentate ligand and an organic phase to generate a first mixture; and
separating the medical isotope from one or more metal ions in the dissolved metallic precursor based on an interaction between the octadentate ligand and the medical isotope.
